{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CFa28pCG9ARcpSnbXoj9Ua","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Scenario A 主导：Llama-70B verbosity 显著（BT ~65%）但 formality NS（BT\n2\t  ~55%）。\n3\t\n4\t  C3 降级为 \"2/3 target judges show formality bias; susceptibility is architecture-dependent\"。\n5\t\n6\t  Llama formality 作为 partial negative case——非所有架构对所有轴均敏感，增加论文 nuance。\n7\t\n8\t  Verbosity 仍有三架构支撑（GPT-4o 76%、Qwen3 77%、Llama ~65%），core claim 不动。\n9\t\n10\t  Per-axis confound structure (C2b) 在 Llama 上复现：verbosity pure pattern 成立（Style OR\n11\t  sig, Orig OR NS）。\n12\t\n13\t  MF1 第5层（Llama independent architecture）部分成立——verbosity ✓, formality ✗。\n14\t\n15\t  降级为 \"4.5/5 layers holding\"，§6 新增 architecture-dependent susceptibility + formality\n16\t  generalizability 两段。\n17\t\n18\t  n_biased_target_judges = 2 (formality) / 3 (verbosity)。\n19\t\n20\t  预期 reviewer score 3.5–4.0，Findings 保底，Main 需要 framing 到位。\n21\t\n22\t  '\n23\timagined_experiments:\n24\t- name: Multi-judge formality pairwise\n25\t  plan_id: exp-001\n26\t  description: 在 Claude Sonnet 和第三方 judge 上复制 formality pairwise 实验。项目演化后实际执行了 Claude\n27\t    Sonnet（负控制）+ Qwen3-32B + Llama-70B。\n28\t  expected_results:\n29\t    claude_bt_formality: 0.562\n30\t    claude_bt_formality_p: 0.091\n31\t    claude_bt_formality_ci:\n32\t    - 0.489\n33\t    - 0.636\n34\t    qwen32b_bt_formality: 0.665\n35\t    qwen32b_bt_formality_p: 0.0001\n36\t    llama_bt_formality: 0.553\n37\t    llama_bt_formality_p: 0.21\n38\t    llama_bt_formality_ci:\n39\t    - 0.476\n40\t    - 0.63\n41\t    n_judges_formality_sig: 2\n42\t    judges_formality_sig:\n43\t    - GPT-4o\n44\t    - Qwen3-32B\n45\t    judges_formality_ns:\n46\t    - Claude Sonnet\n47\t    - Llama-70B\n48\t  result_rationale: 'Claude 已实测为负控制（BT 56.2% NS）。Qwen3-32B 已实测为正（BT 66.5%）。\n49\t\n50\t    Llama-70B 在 median 档 formality BT 落在 52–60% 区间。Rationale：Llama 架构对\n51\t\n52\t    formality 的内在偏好弱于 GPT-4o/Qwen3。Llama 训练数据中 formal/casual 文本分布\n53\t\n54\t    可能更均衡（Meta 训练语料偏 web-crawl，formal/casual 比例接近），导致 formality\n55\t\n56\t    维度上不产生系统性偏好。这与 verbosity 不同——verbosity 偏好是跨架构的 RLHF 副\n57\t\n58\t    产品（所有 chat model 均经历 \"详细回答 > 简短回答\" 的 reward signal）。\n59\t\n60\t    '\n61\t  tables:\n62\t  - caption: 'Table: Formality BT across judges (LLMBar)'\n63\t    rows:\n64\t    - judge: GPT-4o\n65\t      bt: 0.63\n66\t      ci: '[0.558, 0.703]'\n67\t      p: <0.001\n68\t      sig: '***'\n69\t    - judge: Qwen3-32B\n70\t      bt: 0.665\n71\t      ci: '[0.585, 0.739]'\n72\t      p: <0.0001\n73\t      sig: '****'\n74\t    - judge: Llama-70B\n75\t      bt: 0.553\n76\t      ci: '[0.476, 0.630]'\n77\t      p: '0.21'\n78\t      sig: NS\n79\t    - judge: Claude Sonnet\n80\t      bt: 0.562\n81\t      ci: '[0.489, 0.636]'\n82\t      p: '0.091'\n83\t      sig: NS\n84\t  figures_description:\n85\t  - 'Forest plot: 4 judges × formality BT with 95% CI. GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B CI 不包含 0.50；Llama\n86\t    和 Claude CI 包含 0.50。'\n87\t  analysis: 'Formality bias 是 architecture-dependent：GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B 显著，Llama/Claude\n88\t    不显著。\n89\t\n90\t    这不削弱 C2a（Blindspot 在 biased judges 上仍成立），但要求 C3 表述为\n91\t\n92\t    \"CSD diagnoses per-judge susceptibility\" 而非 \"all judges are biased\"。\n93\t\n94\t    Llama formality NS 实际增加了论文可信度——说明 CSD 不是万能 false-positive 机器。\n95\t\n96\t    '\n97\t- name: Multi-benchmark formality pairwise\n98\t  plan_id: exp-002\n99\t  description: CSD pipeline 在 AlpacaEval 和 MT-Bench 上运行 formality counterfactuals。GPT-4o\n100\t    + Qwen3-32B 作为 judges。\n101\t  expected_results:\n102\t    gpt4o_alpacaeval_bt: 0.727\n103\t    gpt4o_alpacaeval_p: 0.0001\n104\t    gpt4o_mtbench_bt: 0.692\n105\t    gpt4o_mtbench_p: 0.0001\n106\t    qwen32b_alpacaeval_bt: 0.657\n107\t    qwen32b_alpacaeval_p: 0.0001\n108\t    qwen32b_mtbench_bt: 0.712\n109\t    qwen32b_mtbench_p: 0.0001\n110\t    llama_alpacaeval_bt: 0.54\n111\t    llama_alpacaeval_p: 0.28\n112\t    llama_mtbench_bt: 0.52\n113\t    llama_mtbench_p: 0.55\n114\t    cross_benchmark_consistent: true\n115\t  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 跨 benchmark 结果已实测（AlpacaEval 72.7%、MT-Bench 69.2%）。Qwen3\n116\t    在\n117\t\n118\t    AlpacaEval/MT-Bench 上预期与 LLMBar 趋势一致（±5pp 波动，benchmark 难度和文本\n119\t\n120\t    特征差异导致）。Llama 在 median 档 formality 跨 benchmark 均 NS——如果 LLMBar\n121\t\n122\t    上 NS，其他 benchmark 也不会突然显著，因为 Llama 架构本身对 formality 不敏感。\n123\t\n124\t    MT-Bench 是个例外场景：GPT-4o Likert 在 MT-Bench 上边际显著（p=0.016），但这\n125\t\n126\t    是因为 MT-Bench 文本更长、Likert 评分方差更大，不改变跨 benchmark 的基本模式。\n127\t\n128\t    '\n129\t  tables:\n130\t  - caption: 'Table: Formality BT across benchmarks × judges'\n131\t    rows:\n132\t    - benchmark: LLMBar\n133\t      gpt4o: 63.0%***\n134\t      qwen32b: 66.5%****\n135\t      llama: 55.3% NS\n136\t    - benchmark: AlpacaEval\n137\t      gpt4o: 72.7%****\n138\t      qwen32b: 65.7%****\n139\t      llama: 54.0% NS\n140\t    - benchmark: MT-Bench\n141\t      gpt4o: 69.2%****\n142\t      qwen32b: 71.2%****\n143\t      llama: 52.0% NS\n144\t  figures_description:\n145\t  - 'Heatmap: 3 benchmarks × 4 judges, 色深度 = BT win probability。Llama 列整体浅色。'\n146\t  analysis: '跨 benchmark 一致性强化了两个结论：(1) formality bias 在 GPT-4o/Qwen3 上是稳健的，\n147\t\n148\t    不依赖特定 benchmark；(2) Llama formality NS 也是稳健的，不是 LLMBar 特有现象。\n149\t\n150\t    这排除了 \"Llama 在 LLMBar 上碰巧 NS\" 的解释。\n151\t\n152\t    '\n153\t- name: Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis across judges\n154\t  plan_id: exp-003\n155\t  description: 每个 judge × benchmark × axis 组合同时计算 Likert ATE 和 BT，系统比较测量敏感度。\n156\t  expected_results:\n157\t    total_cells: 18\n158\t    bt_significant_cells: 10\n159\t    likert_significant_cells: 1\n160\t    both_significant_cells: 1\n161\t    blindspot_rate: 0.9\n162\t    sole_exception: GPT-4o × MT-Bench × formality (Likert d=0.167 p=0.016)\n163\t    verbosity_likert_all_ns: true\n164\t    formality_likert_all_ns_except_mtbench: true\n165\t    llama_formality_bt_ns: true\n166\t    llama_verbosity_bt_sig_likert_ns: true\n167\t  result_rationale: '已有实测数据覆盖大部分 cells。Likert 仅在 MT-Bench formality 上显著（d=0.167），\n168\t\n169\t    其余 17/18 cells 中 Likert 均 NS。原因：Likert 的 tie-heavy 分布（tie rate\n170\t\n171\t    43–73%）系统性地压缩了效应量。MT-Bench 例外是因为其文本较长，Likert 评分方差更大\n172\t\n173\t    （tie rate 较低），恰好突破了检测阈值。但即便在 MT-Bench 上，BT 效应也远强于\n174\t\n175\t    Likert（BT 69.2% vs Likert d=0.167）。Llama verbosity 是新的 Blindspot cell：\n176\t\n177\t    BT ~65% sig 但 Likert NS，进一步确认 Blindspot 不限于 GPT-4o/Qwen3。\n178\t\n179\t    '\n180\t  tables:\n181\t  - caption: 'Table: Sensitivity comparison — BT significant vs Likert significant'\n182\t    rows:\n183\t    - cell: GPT-4o × LLMBar × formality\n184\t      bt: 63.0%***\n185\t      likert: d=-0.07 NS\n186\t      blindspot: 'Yes'\n187\t    - cell: GPT-4o × LLMBar × verbosity\n188\t      bt: 76.0%****\n189\t      likert: d=0.08 NS\n190\t      blindspot: 'Yes'\n191\t    - cell: GPT-4o × MT-Bench × formality\n192\t      bt: 69.2%****\n193\t      likert: d=0.17*\n194\t      blindspot: 'No'\n195\t    - cell: Qwen3 × LLMBar × formality\n196\t      bt: 66.5%****\n197\t      likert: d=0.01 NS\n198\t      blindspot: 'Yes'\n199\t    - cell: Qwen3 × LLMBar × verbosity\n200\t      bt: 77.3%****\n201\t      likert: d=-0.15 NS\n202\t      blindspot: 'Yes'\n203\t    - cell: Llama × LLMBar × verbosity\n204\t      bt: 65.0%**\n205\t      likert: d=0.08 NS\n206\t      blindspot: 'Yes'\n207\t    - cell: Llama × LLMBar × formality\n208\t      bt: 55.3% NS\n209\t      likert: d=0.03 NS\n210\t      blindspot: N/A (BT also NS)\n211\t  figures_description:\n212\t  - 'Scatter plot: x = BT win probability, y = Likert Cohen''s d. 对角线上如果两者一致应正相关；实际数据显示\n213\t    BT 有大效应而 Likert d ≈ 0 的系统偏离。'\n214\t  analysis: '9/10 个 BT-significant cells 中 Likert 均 NS，Blindspot rate 90%。唯一例外\n215\t\n216\t    （MT-Bench formality d=0.167）效应量仍小于 BT 等价效应量的 1/4。这证明\n217\t\n218\t    measurement mode 是 dominant factor——不是某个 judge 或 benchmark 的特例，\n219\t\n220\t    而是 Likert 作为测量工具的系统性缺陷。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t- name: Pairwise RATE control (original vs double-rewrite)\n224\t  plan_id: exp-005\n225\t  description: 原始文本 vs 双重改写文本的 pairwise 比较，量化与风格无关的改写偏好 artifact。扩展到所有 judge × axis\n226\t    组合。\n227\t  expected_results:\n228\t    gpt4o_formality_bt_p_original: 0.418\n229\t    gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n230\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p_original: 0.167\n231\t    gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n232\t    qwen32b_formality_bt_p_original: 0.377\n233\t    qwen32b_formality_p: 0.0006\n234\t    qwen32b_verbosity_bt_p_original: 0.082\n235\t    qwen32b_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n236\t    llama_formality_bt_p_original: 0.42\n237\t    llama_formality_p: 0.06\n238\t    llama_verbosity_bt_p_original: 0.25\n239\t    llama_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n240\t    artifact_confirmed: true\n241\t    gee_controls_for_it: true\n242\t  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 和 Qwen3 实测结果已确认改写 artifact 存在（judges 系统性偏好 LLM-polished\n243\t\n244\t    text over original）。Llama 在 median 档预期类似模式但弱化：formality placebo BT\n245\t\n246\t    ~42%（边际），verbosity placebo BT ~25%（显著）。原因：所有 RLHF-trained judges\n247\t\n248\t    共享对 polished text 的偏好，但强度因架构而异。关键：GEE Orig OR 已控制此 artifact，\n249\t\n250\t    verbosity Orig OR NS 证明 style effect 未被 artifact 污染。Llama placebo 数据\n251\t\n252\t    补完第三架构，但不改变结论——artifact 是 GEE 已知且已控制的 confound。\n253\t\n254\t    '\n255\t  tables: []\n256\t  figures_description:\n257\t  - 'Bar chart: 3 judges × 2 axes, placebo BT P(original)。所有 bar 低于 50% = judges 偏好\n258\t    DR。Verbosity artifact 更强。'\n259\t  analysis: '改写 artifact 跨架构一致。但这恰恰验证了 GEE decomposition 的必要性：\n260\t\n261\t    verbosity Orig OR NS 说明 style OR 未被 artifact 膨胀。\n262\t\n263\t    Formality Orig OR significant = style effect 和 artifact 交织，需 GEE 分离。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t- name: Scaled replication (n=300-500)\n267\t  plan_id: exp-006\n268\t  description: 将 Qwen3-32B formality 从 n=100 扩展到 n=355（NLI-pass）。验证效应稳定性，收窄 CI。\n269\t  expected_results:\n270\t    n_total: 400\n271\t    n_nli_pass: 355\n272\t    nli_pass_rate: 0.888\n273\t    bt_p_formal: 0.675\n274\t    bt_ci:\n275\t    - 0.637\n276\t    - 0.713\n277\t    bt_ci_width_pp: 7.6\n278\t    bt_p: 0.0001\n279\t    likert_ate: -0.059\n280\t    likert_p: 0.5999\n281\t    likert_d: -0.025\n282\t    gee_style_or: 2.15\n283\t    gee_style_p: 0.0001\n284\t    gee_orig_or: 4.99\n285\t    gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n286\t    vs_n100_bt_delta_pp: 1.0\n287\t    vs_n100_ci_improvement: 2x narrower\n288\t  result_rationale: '实测结果：BT 67.5% [63.7%, 71.3%] 与 n=100 时 66.5% [58.5%, 73.9%] 一致（Δ=+1.0pp），\n289\t\n290\t    CI 从 15.4pp 收窄到 7.6pp。Likert d=-0.025 仍完全 NS（p=0.60）。这是 bootstrap\n291\t\n292\t    attenuation curve 的实验确认：n 增大只收窄 CI，不改变 d ≈ 0 的点估计。\n293\t\n294\t    GEE Style OR 从 4.20 降到 2.15 是因为 n=400 样本中 originality confound 分布\n295\t\n296\t    更均匀，Style 和 Orig 效应更清晰地分离。\n297\t\n298\t    '\n299\t  tables:\n300\t  - caption: 'Table: n=100 vs n=355 comparison'\n301\t    rows:\n302\t    - metric: BT P(formal)\n303\t      n100: 66.5% [58.5, 73.9]\n304\t      n355: 67.5% [63.7, 71.3]\n305\t    - metric: Likert d\n306\t      n100: '0.012'\n307\t      n355: '-0.025'\n308\t    - metric: GEE Style OR\n309\t      n100: '4.20'\n310\t      n355: '2.15'\n311\t  figures_description:\n312\t  - 已有 bootstrap attenuation curve figure：d_median flat at -0.017 across n=50→355。\n313\t  analysis: 'Scaled replication 确认三点：(1) BT 效应稳定（非 small-n artifact），\n314\t\n315\t    (2) Likert Blindspot 在大样本下持续（排除 power gap 解释），\n316\t\n317\t    (3) bootstrap attenuation curve 是 smoking gun——d ≈ 0 是 Likert 的结构性上限。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t- name: Non-Qwen rewriter control\n321\t  plan_id: exp-009\n322\t  description: 使用 GPT-4o 作为 rewriter 替代 Qwen3-32B，在 formality 和 verbosity 上比较结果。排除\n323\t    Qwen-family artifact。\n324\t  expected_results:\n325\t    formality_gpt4o_rewriter_bt: 0.644\n326\t    formality_gpt4o_rewriter_ci:\n327\t    - 0.561\n328\t    - 0.728\n329\t    formality_baseline_qwen3_bt: 0.665\n330\t    formality_delta_pp: -2.1\n331\t    formality_ci_overlap: true\n332\t    verbosity_gpt4o_rewriter_bt: 0.735\n333\t    verbosity_gpt4o_rewriter_ci:\n334\t    - 0.654\n335\t    - 0.809\n336\t    verbosity_baseline_qwen3_bt: 0.773\n337\t    verbosity_delta_pp: -3.8\n338\t    verbosity_ci_overlap: true\n339\t    rewriter_independent: true\n340\t  result_rationale: '实测结果：GPT-4o rewriter formality 64.4% vs Qwen3 rewriter 66.5%（Δ=-2.1pp，\n341\t\n342\t    CI 重叠）；verbosity 73.5% vs 77.3%（Δ=-3.8pp，CI 重叠）。两个 rewriter 产生\n343\t\n344\t    统计不可区分的结果，说明检测到的 bias 来自 judge 而非 rewriter。\n345\t\n346\t    GPT-4o rewriter NLI pass rate（formality 90%, verbosity 81%）与 Qwen3（88%, 86%）\n347\t\n348\t    可比，排除了 rewriter 质量差异的解释。\n349\t\n350\t    '\n351\t  tables:\n352\t  - caption: 'Table: Rewriter independence (Qwen3 vs GPT-4o rewriter)'\n353\t    rows:\n354\t    - axis: Formality\n355\t      qwen3_rewriter: 66.5% [58.5, 73.9]\n356\t      gpt4o_rewriter: 64.4% [56.1, 72.8]\n357\t      delta: -2.1pp\n358\t      overlap: 'Yes'\n359\t    - axis: Verbosity\n360\t      qwen3_rewriter: 77.3% [70.3, 84.3]\n361\t      gpt4o_rewriter: 73.5% [65.4, 80.9]\n362\t      delta: -3.8pp\n363\t      overlap: 'Yes'\n364\t  figures_description: []\n365\t  analysis: 'Rewriter independence 是 CSD pipeline 的核心假设之一。实测结果排除了\n366\t\n367\t    \"Qwen3-32B rewriter 引入 systematic artifact that only Qwen3 judge detects\"\n368\t\n369\t    的循环依赖假设。两个不同架构家族的 rewriter 产生一致结果 = bias 在 judge 端。\n370\t\n371\t    '\n372\t- name: GPT-4o verbosity + register scoring (API)\n373\t  plan_id: exp-020\n374\t  description: GPT-4o API 在 verbosity 和 register counterfactual pairs 上的 pairwise\n375\t    + Likert 评分。\n376\t  expected_results:\n377\t    verbosity_bt: 0.76\n378\t    verbosity_bt_ci:\n379\t    - 0.688\n380\t    - 0.828\n381\t    verbosity_bt_p: 0.0001\n382\t    verbosity_likert_ate: 0.116\n383\t    verbosity_likert_p: 0.403\n384\t    verbosity_likert_d: 0.078\n385\t    verbosity_gee_style_or: 10.97\n386\t    verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.437\n387\t    verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.051\n388\t    verbosity_blindspot: true\n389\t    register_bt: 0.57\n390\t    register_bt_ci:\n391\t    - 0.5\n392\t    - 0.64\n393\t    register_bt_p: 0.04\n394\t    register_likert_ate: 0.0\n395\t    register_likert_p: 0.785\n396\t    register_gee_style_or: 1.876\n397\t    register_gee_orig_or: 2.21\n398\t    register_blindspot: true\n399\t  result_rationale: '实测结果。Verbosity BT 76.0% 与 Qwen3 77.3% 高度一致——verbosity bias 跨架构\n400\t\n401\t    稳定。GEE Style OR=10.97 确认 pure style pattern（Orig OR NS）。Likert ATE=+0.12\n402\t\n403\t    方向正确但 p=0.40 完全 NS，Blindspot 确认。Register BT 57.0% 边际显著，\n404\t\n405\t    GEE 分解后 originality dominant（OR=2.21 > Style OR=1.88），与 Qwen3 register\n406\t\n407\t    模式一致。两个 judge 在 register 上均显示 originality-dominated pattern。\n408\t\n409\t    '\n410\t  tables: []\n411\t  figures_description: []\n412\t  analysis: 'GPT-4o verbosity 补完了 Evidence Matrix 的关键 cell。三个结论：\n413\t\n414\t    (1) Verbosity pure style pattern 跨 GPT-4o/Qwen3 一致（OR 11 vs 13）。\n415\t\n416\t    (2) Register originality-dominated pattern 跨 judge 一致。\n417\t\n418\t    (3) Verbosity Likert Blindspot 在 GPT-4o 上也成立（d=0.078 NS vs BT 76%）。\n419\t\n420\t    '\n421\t- name: Third target judge — Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct\n422\t  plan_id: exp-021\n423\t  description: Llama-3.3-70B 作为第三个 target judge，在 LLMBar verbosity + formality 上运行完整\n424\t    CSD pipeline（pairwise BT + Likert + GEE decomposition）。\n425\t  expected_results:\n426\t    verbosity_bt: 0.652\n427\t    verbosity_bt_ci:\n428\t    - 0.572\n429\t    - 0.728\n430\t    verbosity_bt_p: 0.0003\n431\t    verbosity_likert_ate: 0.085\n432\t    verbosity_likert_p: 0.46\n433\t    verbosity_likert_d: 0.082\n434\t    verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.61\n435\t    verbosity_blindspot: true\n436\t    verbosity_consistency_rate: 0.67\n437\t    verbosity_gee_style_or: 5.48\n438\t    verbosity_gee_style_ci:\n439\t    - 2.31\n440\t    - 13.0\n441\t    verbosity_gee_style_p: 0.0001\n442\t    verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.62\n443\t    verbosity_gee_orig_ci:\n444\t    - 0.27\n445\t    - 1.42\n446\t    verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.26\n447\t    verbosity_direction_verbose_to_concise_pref: 0.72\n448\t    verbosity_direction_concise_to_verbose_pref: 0.83\n449\t    formality_bt: 0.553\n450\t    formality_bt_ci:\n451\t    - 0.476\n452\t    - 0.63\n453\t    formality_bt_p: 0.21\n454\t    formality_likert_ate: 0.025\n455\t    formality_likert_p: 0.82\n456\t    formality_likert_d: 0.023\n457\t    formality_likert_tie_rate: 0.7\n458\t    formality_blindspot: false\n459\t    formality_consistency_rate: 0.58\n460\t    formality_gee_style_or: 1.35\n461\t    formality_gee_style_ci:\n462\t    - 0.71\n463\t    - 2.57\n464\t    formality_gee_style_p: 0.36\n465\t    formality_gee_orig_or: 3.82\n466\t    formality_gee_orig_ci:\n467\t    - 1.92\n468\t    - 7.6\n469\t    formality_gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n470\t    formality_direction_formal_to_casual_win: 0.62\n471\t    formality_direction_casual_to_formal_win: 0.48\n472\t    n_pairs_verbosity: 86\n473\t    n_pairs_formality: 88\n474\t    biased_axes:\n475\t    - verbosity\n476\t    unbiased_axes:\n477\t    - formality\n478\t  result_rationale: 'Verbosity BT 65.2%：Llama 检测到 verbose 偏好，但弱于 GPT-4o（76%）和 Qwen3（77%）。\n479\t\n480\t    原因：Llama-3.3 的 RLHF 训练使用 Meta 内部 reward model，其 verbosity reward\n481\t\n482\t    信号可能弱于 GPT-4o/Qwen3 的训练信号，但方向一致——所有 chat RLHF 都隐含\n483\t\n484\t    \"更详细 = 更好\"。GEE verbosity Style OR=5.48（vs GPT-4o 10.97, Qwen3 13.10）\n485\t\n486\t    确认 pure style pattern：Orig OR NS，风格效应独立于改写 artifact。这是 C2b\n487\t\n488\t    per-axis confound structure 在第三架构上的复现。\n489\t\n490\t\n491\t    Formality BT 55.3%：Llama 对 formality 没有统计显著偏好。原因：formality 偏好\n492\t\n493\t    是 architecture-specific 的。GPT-4o 和 Qwen3 的 system prompt/RLHF 倾向于\n494\t\n495\t    formal 输出风格（OpenAI 和 Alibaba 的 alignment 偏好），而 Llama 的 alignment\n496\t\n497\t    更中性。GEE 分解揭示 formality Style OR=1.35 NS 但 Orig OR=3.82 sig——\n498\t\n499\t    judges 偏好原始文本（改写 artifact），但没有方向性 formality 偏好。\n500\t\n501\t    这与 Claude 负控制模式不同（Claude Style OR=1.47 NS, Orig OR=6.66 sig）：\n502\t\n503\t    Claude 完全无偏，Llama formality 仅仅是边际——BT 55.3% 方向正确但 power 不足。\n504\t\n505\t\n506\t    Likert 在两轴均 NS（formality d=0.023, verbosity d=0.082），但 verbosity\n507\t\n508\t    BT 显著 → Blindspot 在 Llama 上也成立。这是 median 档的核心贡献：\n509\t\n510\t    第三架构确认 verbosity Blindspot，同时 formality NS 增加了 nuance。\n511\t\n512\t    '\n513\t  tables:\n514\t  - caption: 'Table: Llama-70B CSD results (LLMBar)'\n515\t    rows:\n516\t    - axis: Verbosity\n517\t      bt: 65.2% [57.2, 72.8]\n518\t      bt_p: '0.0003'\n519\t      likert_d: '0.082'\n520\t      likert_p: '0.46'\n521\t      gee_style_or: 5.48***\n522\t      gee_orig_or: 0.62 NS\n523\t      pattern: Pure style\n524\t      blindspot: 'Yes'\n525\t    - axis: Formality\n526\t      bt: 55.3% [47.6, 63.0]\n527\t      bt_p: '0.21'\n528\t      likert_d: '0.023'\n529\t      likert_p: '0.82'\n530\t      gee_style_or: 1.35 NS\n531\t      gee_orig_or: 3.82***\n532\t      pattern: Originality only\n533\t      blindspot: N/A\n534\t  - caption: 'Table: Updated Evidence Matrix — all 4 judges × 2 axes'\n535\t    rows:\n536\t    - judge: GPT-4o\n537\t      verbosity_bt: 76.0%****\n538\t      verbosity_gee_pattern: Pure style (OR=10.97)\n539\t      formality_bt: 63.0%***\n540\t      formality_gee_pattern: Conditional (OR=2.21)\n541\t    - judge: Qwen3-32B\n542\t      verbosity_bt: 77.3%****\n543\t      verbosity_gee_pattern: Pure style (OR=13.10)\n544\t      formality_bt: 66.5%****\n545\t      formality_gee_pattern: Conditional (OR=4.20)\n546\t    - judge: Llama-70B\n547\t      verbosity_bt: 65.2%***\n548\t      verbosity_gee_pattern: Pure style (OR=5.48)\n549\t      formality_bt: 55.3% NS\n550\t      formality_gee_pattern: Originality only (OR=1.35 NS)\n551\t    - judge: Claude Sonnet\n552\t      verbosity_bt: 54.1% NS\n553\t      verbosity_gee_pattern: None (OR=1.52 NS)\n554\t      formality_bt: 56.2% NS\n555\t      formality_gee_pattern: None (OR=1.47 NS)\n556\t  figures_description:\n557\t  - 'Forest plot: 4 judges × verbosity BT。三个 target judges（GPT-4o, Qwen3, Llama）CI\n558\t    不包含 50%，Claude CI 包含 50%。Llama 效应弱于 GPT-4o/Qwen3 但方向一致。'\n559\t  - 'Forest plot: 4 judges × formality BT。仅 GPT-4o/Qwen3 CI 不包含 50%。Llama 和 Claude\n560\t    均 NS。'\n561\t  - 'GEE OR comparison: 3 judges × verbosity。Style OR 梯度 Qwen3 13.1 > GPT-4o 11.0\n562\t    > Llama 5.5，Orig OR 全部 NS。Per-axis confound pattern 跨架构复现。'\n563\t  analysis: \"Llama 结果构成 median 档的核心叙事：\\n(1) Verbosity bias 三架构确认（3/3 target judges\\\n564\t    \\ sig）。GEE pure style pattern\\n    也三架构复现（Orig OR NS in all three）。这是 C2b 最强证据。\\n\\\n565\t    (2) Formality bias 仅 2/3 target judges sig。C3 需要调整：\\n    \\\"CSD reveals architecture-dependent\\\n566\t    \\ susceptibility—GPT-4o and Qwen3-32B\\n    show significant formality bias while\\\n567\t    \\ Llama-70B does not, suggesting that\\n    formality preference is shaped by model-specific\\\n568\t    \\ alignment rather than being\\n    an inherent property of pairwise evaluation.\\\"\\\n569\t    \\n(3) MF1 第5层（Llama）部分成立：verbosity ✓ formality ✗。\\n    不能说 \\\"5 independent controls\\\n570\t    \\ all hold\\\"，改为\\n    \\\"five controls, four of which hold fully; the fifth (Llama\\\n571\t    \\ replication)\\n    holds for verbosity but not formality, consistent with architecture-dependent\\n\\\n572\t    \\    susceptibility.\\\"\\n(4) Llama formality 不是负控制（Claude 是负控制——两轴均 NS）。\\n    Llama\\\n573\t    \\ 是 partial case：一轴 sig 一轴 NS = axis-dependent + architecture-dependent\\n    交互。这比简单的\\\n574\t    \\ \\\"all judges biased\\\" 更有趣，也更可信。\\n\"\n575\t- name: Double-rewrite placebo BT (anti-amplification control)\n576\t  plan_id: exp-022\n577\t  description: 原始文本 vs 双重改写文本的 BT 比较，量化 format-level amplification 风险。GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B\n578\t    + Llama。\n579\t  expected_results:\n580\t    gpt4o_formality_bt_p_orig: 0.418\n581\t    gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n582\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p_orig: 0.167\n583\t    gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n584\t    qwen32b_formality_bt_p_orig: 0.377\n585\t    qwen32b_formality_p: 0.0006\n586\t    qwen32b_verbosity_bt_p_orig: 0.082\n587\t    qwen32b_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n588\t    llama_formality_bt_p_orig: 0.425\n589\t    llama_formality_p: 0.08\n590\t    llama_verbosity_bt_p_orig: 0.22\n591\t    llama_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n592\t    artifact_direction: DR preferred over original (all judges, all axes)\n593\t    gee_controls_for_it: true\n594\t  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 和 Qwen3 实测结果已确认。Llama placebo预期：formality P(orig)≈42.5%\n595\t\n596\t    （弱于 Qwen3 的 37.7%，因 Llama 对 formality 整体不敏感所以 artifact 也弱），\n597\t\n598\t    verbosity P(orig)≈22%（verbosity artifact 仍强因为 RLHF 普遍偏好 verbose content）。\n599\t\n600\t    关键论点不变：artifact 存在 → GEE Orig OR 已控制 → verbosity Orig OR NS = pure style。\n601\t\n602\t    '\n603\t  tables: []\n604\t  figures_description: []\n605\t  analysis: 'Llama placebo 补完第三架构。三个 judges 均偏好 DR over original，确认改写\n606\t\n607\t    artifact 是 universal phenomenon。但 GEE 已经控制了它，verbosity 结论不受影响。\n608\t\n609\t    '\n610\t- name: NLI gate ablation (content-mediated signal quantification)\n611\t  plan_id: exp-023\n612\t  description: NLI-pass vs NLI-fail pairs 的 BT 比较，量化 content-mediated signal 比例。\n613\t  expected_results:\n614\t    formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.665\n615\t    formality_nli_pass_p: 0.0001\n616\t    formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.417\n617\t    formality_nli_fail_p: 0.69\n618\t    formality_nli_fail_n: 12\n619\t    verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.773\n620\t    verbosity_nli_pass_p: 0.0001\n621\t    verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.75\n622\t    verbosity_nli_fail_p: 0.006\n623\t    verbosity_nli_fail_n: 14\n624\t    llama_formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.44\n625\t    llama_formality_nli_fail_note: n≈12, too small for reliable estimate\n626\t    llama_verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.68\n627\t    llama_verbosity_nli_fail_note: still significant, consistent with pure style\n628\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3 实测结果（formality NLI-fail BT reversal to 41.7%，verbosity\n629\t    NLI-fail\n630\t\n631\t    stable at 75%）是 MF1 Layer 1 的核心证据。NLI-fail formality pairs 中内容差异\n632\t\n633\t    主导 → 移除 NLI gate 后 formal preference 消失甚至反转（judges 偏好实际内容\n634\t\n635\t    更好的那个，碰巧是 casual 方向）。Verbosity NLI-fail 仍强 → style bias 太强，\n636\t\n637\t    即使内容有差异也压不住。Llama 在 median 档的 NLI-fail 结果应与 Qwen3 一致\n638\t\n639\t    （方向相同），但因 Llama formality 本身 NS，NLI-fail reversal 不显著。\n640\t\n641\t    '\n642\t  tables: []\n643\t  figures_description: []\n644\t  analysis: 'NLI gate ablation 是最强 anti-amplification 证据。如果 pairwise 格式放大偏差，\n645\t\n646\t    移除 NLI gate 应进一步放大——但 formality 反而反转。这证明 NLI gate 清除\n647\t\n648\t    content noise，不放大 style signal。\n649\t\n650\t    '\n651\t- name: Cross-axis gradient formalization\n652\t  plan_id: exp-024\n653\t  description: NLI rejection rate（操纵侵入性代理）vs BT 的跨轴梯度，定性 anti-amplification 论证。\n654\t  expected_results:\n655\t    register_nli_rejection: 0.06\n656\t    register_bt: 0.553\n657\t    formality_nli_rejection: 0.12\n658\t    formality_bt: 0.665\n659\t    verbosity_nli_rejection: 0.14\n660\t    verbosity_bt: 0.773\n661\t    correlation_direction: positive\n662\t    n_points: 3\n663\t  result_rationale: '实测结果。三轴形成正梯度：register（低侵入 6%→弱 BT 55%）< formality（中侵入\n664\t\n665\t    12%→中 BT 67%）< verbosity（高侵入 14%→强 BT 77%）。如果 pairwise 格式统一\n666\t\n667\t    放大偏差，三轴应显示相似 BT（因为格式相同）。但 BT 与操纵侵入性正相关，\n668\t\n669\t    说明检测到的信号大小与实际操纵强度匹配——即 detection 而非 amplification。\n670\t\n671\t    仅 3 个数据点，定性论证，不做统计检验。\n672\t\n673\t    '\n674\t  tables: []\n675\t  figures_description:\n676\t  - 'Scatter: x = NLI rejection rate, y = BT。3 点 + 趋势线。定性正相关。'\n677\t  analysis: 'Cross-axis gradient 是 §5.2 中的定性 supporting evidence，3 点不足以做统计推断。\n678\t\n679\t    但方向一致性增加了 anti-amplification 论证的整体可信度。与 NLI ablation 和\n680\t\n681\t    Claude negative control 形成三层 converging evidence。'\n682\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"84c1e33b-a907-4d62-a6bc-d61bef62f953","uuid":"905f060a-00e6-48cb-a0b3-2d65a8fcdfd3","timestamp":"2026-05-21T16:10:30.131Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T152517/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Scenario A 主导：Llama-70B verbosity 显著（BT ~65%）但 formality NS（BT\n  ~55%）。\n\n  C3 降级为 \"2/3 target judges show formality bias; susceptibility is architecture-dependent\"。\n\n  Llama formality 作为 partial negative case——非所有架构对所有轴均敏感，增加论文 nuance。\n\n  Verbosity 仍有三架构支撑（GPT-4o 76%、Qwen3 77%、Llama ~65%），core claim 不动。\n\n  Per-axis confound structure (C2b) 在 Llama 上复现：verbosity pure pattern 成立（Style OR\n  sig, Orig OR NS）。\n\n  MF1 第5层（Llama independent architecture）部分成立——verbosity ✓, formality ✗。\n\n  降级为 \"4.5/5 layers holding\"，§6 新增 architecture-dependent susceptibility + formality\n  generalizability 两段。\n\n  n_biased_target_judges = 2 (formality) / 3 (verbosity)。\n\n  预期 reviewer score 3.5–4.0，Findings 保底，Main 需要 framing 到位。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Multi-judge formality pairwise\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 在 Claude Sonnet 和第三方 judge 上复制 formality pairwise 实验。项目演化后实际执行了 Claude\n    Sonnet（负控制）+ Qwen3-32B + Llama-70B。\n  expected_results:\n    claude_bt_formality: 0.562\n    claude_bt_formality_p: 0.091\n    claude_bt_formality_ci:\n    - 0.489\n    - 0.636\n    qwen32b_bt_formality: 0.665\n    qwen32b_bt_formality_p: 0.0001\n    llama_bt_formality: 0.553\n    llama_bt_formality_p: 0.21\n    llama_bt_formality_ci:\n    - 0.476\n    - 0.63\n    n_judges_formality_sig: 2\n    judges_formality_sig:\n    - GPT-4o\n    - Qwen3-32B\n    judges_formality_ns:\n    - Claude Sonnet\n    - Llama-70B\n  result_rationale: 'Claude 已实测为负控制（BT 56.2% NS）。Qwen3-32B 已实测为正（BT 66.5%）。\n\n    Llama-70B 在 median 档 formality BT 落在 52–60% 区间。Rationale：Llama 架构对\n\n    formality 的内在偏好弱于 GPT-4o/Qwen3。Llama 训练数据中 formal/casual 文本分布\n\n    可能更均衡（Meta 训练语料偏 web-crawl，formal/casual 比例接近），导致 formality\n\n    维度上不产生系统性偏好。这与 verbosity 不同——verbosity 偏好是跨架构的 RLHF 副\n\n    产品（所有 chat model 均经历 \"详细回答 > 简短回答\" 的 reward signal）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Formality BT across judges (LLMBar)'\n    rows:\n    - judge: GPT-4o\n      bt: 0.63\n      ci: '[0.558, 0.703]'\n      p: <0.001\n      sig: '***'\n    - judge: Qwen3-32B\n      bt: 0.665\n      ci: '[0.585, 0.739]'\n      p: <0.0001\n      sig: '****'\n    - judge: Llama-70B\n      bt: 0.553\n      ci: '[0.476, 0.630]'\n      p: '0.21'\n      sig: NS\n    - judge: Claude Sonnet\n      bt: 0.562\n      ci: '[0.489, 0.636]'\n      p: '0.091'\n      sig: NS\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 4 judges × formality BT with 95% CI. GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B CI 不包含 0.50；Llama\n    和 Claude CI 包含 0.50。'\n  analysis: 'Formality bias 是 architecture-dependent：GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B 显著，Llama/Claude\n    不显著。\n\n    这不削弱 C2a（Blindspot 在 biased judges 上仍成立），但要求 C3 表述为\n\n    \"CSD diagnoses per-judge susceptibility\" 而非 \"all judges are biased\"。\n\n    Llama formality NS 实际增加了论文可信度——说明 CSD 不是万能 false-positive 机器。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark formality pairwise\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: CSD pipeline 在 AlpacaEval 和 MT-Bench 上运行 formality counterfactuals。GPT-4o\n    + Qwen3-32B 作为 judges。\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_alpacaeval_bt: 0.727\n    gpt4o_alpacaeval_p: 0.0001\n    gpt4o_mtbench_bt: 0.692\n    gpt4o_mtbench_p: 0.0001\n    qwen32b_alpacaeval_bt: 0.657\n    qwen32b_alpacaeval_p: 0.0001\n    qwen32b_mtbench_bt: 0.712\n    qwen32b_mtbench_p: 0.0001\n    llama_alpacaeval_bt: 0.54\n    llama_alpacaeval_p: 0.28\n    llama_mtbench_bt: 0.52\n    llama_mtbench_p: 0.55\n    cross_benchmark_consistent: true\n  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 跨 benchmark 结果已实测（AlpacaEval 72.7%、MT-Bench 69.2%）。Qwen3\n    在\n\n    AlpacaEval/MT-Bench 上预期与 LLMBar 趋势一致（±5pp 波动，benchmark 难度和文本\n\n    特征差异导致）。Llama 在 median 档 formality 跨 benchmark 均 NS——如果 LLMBar\n\n    上 NS，其他 benchmark 也不会突然显著，因为 Llama 架构本身对 formality 不敏感。\n\n    MT-Bench 是个例外场景：GPT-4o Likert 在 MT-Bench 上边际显著（p=0.016），但这\n\n    是因为 MT-Bench 文本更长、Likert 评分方差更大，不改变跨 benchmark 的基本模式。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Formality BT across benchmarks × judges'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: LLMBar\n      gpt4o: 63.0%***\n      qwen32b: 66.5%****\n      llama: 55.3% NS\n    - benchmark: AlpacaEval\n      gpt4o: 72.7%****\n      qwen32b: 65.7%****\n      llama: 54.0% NS\n    - benchmark: MT-Bench\n      gpt4o: 69.2%****\n      qwen32b: 71.2%****\n      llama: 52.0% NS\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 3 benchmarks × 4 judges, 色深度 = BT win probability。Llama 列整体浅色。'\n  analysis: '跨 benchmark 一致性强化了两个结论：(1) formality bias 在 GPT-4o/Qwen3 上是稳健的，\n\n    不依赖特定 benchmark；(2) Llama formality NS 也是稳健的，不是 LLMBar 特有现象。\n\n    这排除了 \"Llama 在 LLMBar 上碰巧 NS\" 的解释。\n\n    '\n- name: Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis across judges\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 每个 judge × benchmark × axis 组合同时计算 Likert ATE 和 BT，系统比较测量敏感度。\n  expected_results:\n    total_cells: 18\n    bt_significant_cells: 10\n    likert_significant_cells: 1\n    both_significant_cells: 1\n    blindspot_rate: 0.9\n    sole_exception: GPT-4o × MT-Bench × formality (Likert d=0.167 p=0.016)\n    verbosity_likert_all_ns: true\n    formality_likert_all_ns_except_mtbench: true\n    llama_formality_bt_ns: true\n    llama_verbosity_bt_sig_likert_ns: true\n  result_rationale: '已有实测数据覆盖大部分 cells。Likert 仅在 MT-Bench formality 上显著（d=0.167），\n\n    其余 17/18 cells 中 Likert 均 NS。原因：Likert 的 tie-heavy 分布（tie rate\n\n    43–73%）系统性地压缩了效应量。MT-Bench 例外是因为其文本较长，Likert 评分方差更大\n\n    （tie rate 较低），恰好突破了检测阈值。但即便在 MT-Bench 上，BT 效应也远强于\n\n    Likert（BT 69.2% vs Likert d=0.167）。Llama verbosity 是新的 Blindspot cell：\n\n    BT ~65% sig 但 Likert NS，进一步确认 Blindspot 不限于 GPT-4o/Qwen3。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Sensitivity comparison — BT significant vs Likert significant'\n    rows:\n    - cell: GPT-4o × LLMBar × formality\n      bt: 63.0%***\n      likert: d=-0.07 NS\n      blindspot: 'Yes'\n    - cell: GPT-4o × LLMBar × verbosity\n      bt: 76.0%****\n      likert: d=0.08 NS\n      blindspot: 'Yes'\n    - cell: GPT-4o × MT-Bench × formality\n      bt: 69.2%****\n      likert: d=0.17*\n      blindspot: 'No'\n    - cell: Qwen3 × LLMBar × formality\n      bt: 66.5%****\n      likert: d=0.01 NS\n      blindspot: 'Yes'\n    - cell: Qwen3 × LLMBar × verbosity\n      bt: 77.3%****\n      likert: d=-0.15 NS\n      blindspot: 'Yes'\n    - cell: Llama × LLMBar × verbosity\n      bt: 65.0%**\n      likert: d=0.08 NS\n      blindspot: 'Yes'\n    - cell: Llama × LLMBar × formality\n      bt: 55.3% NS\n      likert: d=0.03 NS\n      blindspot: N/A (BT also NS)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: x = BT win probability, y = Likert Cohen''s d. 对角线上如果两者一致应正相关；实际数据显示\n    BT 有大效应而 Likert d ≈ 0 的系统偏离。'\n  analysis: '9/10 个 BT-significant cells 中 Likert 均 NS，Blindspot rate 90%。唯一例外\n\n    （MT-Bench formality d=0.167）效应量仍小于 BT 等价效应量的 1/4。这证明\n\n    measurement mode 是 dominant factor——不是某个 judge 或 benchmark 的特例，\n\n    而是 Likert 作为测量工具的系统性缺陷。\n\n    '\n- name: Pairwise RATE control (original vs double-rewrite)\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 原始文本 vs 双重改写文本的 pairwise 比较，量化与风格无关的改写偏好 artifact。扩展到所有 judge × axis\n    组合。\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_formality_bt_p_original: 0.418\n    gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p_original: 0.167\n    gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    qwen32b_formality_bt_p_original: 0.377\n    qwen32b_formality_p: 0.0006\n    qwen32b_verbosity_bt_p_original: 0.082\n    qwen32b_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    llama_formality_bt_p_original: 0.42\n    llama_formality_p: 0.06\n    llama_verbosity_bt_p_original: 0.25\n    llama_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    artifact_confirmed: true\n    gee_controls_for_it: true\n  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 和 Qwen3 实测结果已确认改写 artifact 存在（judges 系统性偏好 LLM-polished\n\n    text over original）。Llama 在 median 档预期类似模式但弱化：formality placebo BT\n\n    ~42%（边际），verbosity placebo BT ~25%（显著）。原因：所有 RLHF-trained judges\n\n    共享对 polished text 的偏好，但强度因架构而异。关键：GEE Orig OR 已控制此 artifact，\n\n    verbosity Orig OR NS 证明 style effect 未被 artifact 污染。Llama placebo 数据\n\n    补完第三架构，但不改变结论——artifact 是 GEE 已知且已控制的 confound。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 3 judges × 2 axes, placebo BT P(original)。所有 bar 低于 50% = judges 偏好\n    DR。Verbosity artifact 更强。'\n  analysis: '改写 artifact 跨架构一致。但这恰恰验证了 GEE decomposition 的必要性：\n\n    verbosity Orig OR NS 说明 style OR 未被 artifact 膨胀。\n\n    Formality Orig OR significant = style effect 和 artifact 交织，需 GEE 分离。\n\n    '\n- name: Scaled replication (n=300-500)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 将 Qwen3-32B formality 从 n=100 扩展到 n=355（NLI-pass）。验证效应稳定性，收窄 CI。\n  expected_results:\n    n_total: 400\n    n_nli_pass: 355\n    nli_pass_rate: 0.888\n    bt_p_formal: 0.675\n    bt_ci:\n    - 0.637\n    - 0.713\n    bt_ci_width_pp: 7.6\n    bt_p: 0.0001\n    likert_ate: -0.059\n    likert_p: 0.5999\n    likert_d: -0.025\n    gee_style_or: 2.15\n    gee_style_p: 0.0001\n    gee_orig_or: 4.99\n    gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n    vs_n100_bt_delta_pp: 1.0\n    vs_n100_ci_improvement: 2x narrower\n  result_rationale: '实测结果：BT 67.5% [63.7%, 71.3%] 与 n=100 时 66.5% [58.5%, 73.9%] 一致（Δ=+1.0pp），\n\n    CI 从 15.4pp 收窄到 7.6pp。Likert d=-0.025 仍完全 NS（p=0.60）。这是 bootstrap\n\n    attenuation curve 的实验确认：n 增大只收窄 CI，不改变 d ≈ 0 的点估计。\n\n    GEE Style OR 从 4.20 降到 2.15 是因为 n=400 样本中 originality confound 分布\n\n    更均匀，Style 和 Orig 效应更清晰地分离。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: n=100 vs n=355 comparison'\n    rows:\n    - metric: BT P(formal)\n      n100: 66.5% [58.5, 73.9]\n      n355: 67.5% [63.7, 71.3]\n    - metric: Likert d\n      n100: '0.012'\n      n355: '-0.025'\n    - metric: GEE Style OR\n      n100: '4.20'\n      n355: '2.15'\n  figures_description:\n  - 已有 bootstrap attenuation curve figure：d_median flat at -0.017 across n=50→355。\n  analysis: 'Scaled replication 确认三点：(1) BT 效应稳定（非 small-n artifact），\n\n    (2) Likert Blindspot 在大样本下持续（排除 power gap 解释），\n\n    (3) bootstrap attenuation curve 是 smoking gun——d ≈ 0 是 Likert 的结构性上限。\n\n    '\n- name: Non-Qwen rewriter control\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 使用 GPT-4o 作为 rewriter 替代 Qwen3-32B，在 formality 和 verbosity 上比较结果。排除\n    Qwen-family artifact。\n  expected_results:\n    formality_gpt4o_rewriter_bt: 0.644\n    formality_gpt4o_rewriter_ci:\n    - 0.561\n    - 0.728\n    formality_baseline_qwen3_bt: 0.665\n    formality_delta_pp: -2.1\n    formality_ci_overlap: true\n    verbosity_gpt4o_rewriter_bt: 0.735\n    verbosity_gpt4o_rewriter_ci:\n    - 0.654\n    - 0.809\n    verbosity_baseline_qwen3_bt: 0.773\n    verbosity_delta_pp: -3.8\n    verbosity_ci_overlap: true\n    rewriter_independent: true\n  result_rationale: '实测结果：GPT-4o rewriter formality 64.4% vs Qwen3 rewriter 66.5%（Δ=-2.1pp，\n\n    CI 重叠）；verbosity 73.5% vs 77.3%（Δ=-3.8pp，CI 重叠）。两个 rewriter 产生\n\n    统计不可区分的结果，说明检测到的 bias 来自 judge 而非 rewriter。\n\n    GPT-4o rewriter NLI pass rate（formality 90%, verbosity 81%）与 Qwen3（88%, 86%）\n\n    可比，排除了 rewriter 质量差异的解释。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Rewriter independence (Qwen3 vs GPT-4o rewriter)'\n    rows:\n    - axis: Formality\n      qwen3_rewriter: 66.5% [58.5, 73.9]\n      gpt4o_rewriter: 64.4% [56.1, 72.8]\n      delta: -2.1pp\n      overlap: 'Yes'\n    - axis: Verbosity\n      qwen3_rewriter: 77.3% [70.3, 84.3]\n      gpt4o_rewriter: 73.5% [65.4, 80.9]\n      delta: -3.8pp\n      overlap: 'Yes'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Rewriter independence 是 CSD pipeline 的核心假设之一。实测结果排除了\n\n    \"Qwen3-32B rewriter 引入 systematic artifact that only Qwen3 judge detects\"\n\n    的循环依赖假设。两个不同架构家族的 rewriter 产生一致结果 = bias 在 judge 端。\n\n    '\n- name: GPT-4o verbosity + register scoring (API)\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: GPT-4o API 在 verbosity 和 register counterfactual pairs 上的 pairwise\n    + Likert 评分。\n  expected_results:\n    verbosity_bt: 0.76\n    verbosity_bt_ci:\n    - 0.688\n    - 0.828\n    verbosity_bt_p: 0.0001\n    verbosity_likert_ate: 0.116\n    verbosity_likert_p: 0.403\n    verbosity_likert_d: 0.078\n    verbosity_gee_style_or: 10.97\n    verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.437\n    verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.051\n    verbosity_blindspot: true\n    register_bt: 0.57\n    register_bt_ci:\n    - 0.5\n    - 0.64\n    register_bt_p: 0.04\n    register_likert_ate: 0.0\n    register_likert_p: 0.785\n    register_gee_style_or: 1.876\n    register_gee_orig_or: 2.21\n    register_blindspot: true\n  result_rationale: '实测结果。Verbosity BT 76.0% 与 Qwen3 77.3% 高度一致——verbosity bias 跨架构\n\n    稳定。GEE Style OR=10.97 确认 pure style pattern（Orig OR NS）。Likert ATE=+0.12\n\n    方向正确但 p=0.40 完全 NS，Blindspot 确认。Register BT 57.0% 边际显著，\n\n    GEE 分解后 originality dominant（OR=2.21 > Style OR=1.88），与 Qwen3 register\n\n    模式一致。两个 judge 在 register 上均显示 originality-dominated pattern。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'GPT-4o verbosity 补完了 Evidence Matrix 的关键 cell。三个结论：\n\n    (1) Verbosity pure style pattern 跨 GPT-4o/Qwen3 一致（OR 11 vs 13）。\n\n    (2) Register originality-dominated pattern 跨 judge 一致。\n\n    (3) Verbosity Likert Blindspot 在 GPT-4o 上也成立（d=0.078 NS vs BT 76%）。\n\n    '\n- name: Third target judge — Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct\n  plan_id: exp-021\n  description: Llama-3.3-70B 作为第三个 target judge，在 LLMBar verbosity + formality 上运行完整\n    CSD pipeline（pairwise BT + Likert + GEE decomposition）。\n  expected_results:\n    verbosity_bt: 0.652\n    verbosity_bt_ci:\n    - 0.572\n    - 0.728\n    verbosity_bt_p: 0.0003\n    verbosity_likert_ate: 0.085\n    verbosity_likert_p: 0.46\n    verbosity_likert_d: 0.082\n    verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.61\n    verbosity_blindspot: true\n    verbosity_consistency_rate: 0.67\n    verbosity_gee_style_or: 5.48\n    verbosity_gee_style_ci:\n    - 2.31\n    - 13.0\n    verbosity_gee_style_p: 0.0001\n    verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.62\n    verbosity_gee_orig_ci:\n    - 0.27\n    - 1.42\n    verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.26\n    verbosity_direction_verbose_to_concise_pref: 0.72\n    verbosity_direction_concise_to_verbose_pref: 0.83\n    formality_bt: 0.553\n    formality_bt_ci:\n    - 0.476\n    - 0.63\n    formality_bt_p: 0.21\n    formality_likert_ate: 0.025\n    formality_likert_p: 0.82\n    formality_likert_d: 0.023\n    formality_likert_tie_rate: 0.7\n    formality_blindspot: false\n    formality_consistency_rate: 0.58\n    formality_gee_style_or: 1.35\n    formality_gee_style_ci:\n    - 0.71\n    - 2.57\n    formality_gee_style_p: 0.36\n    formality_gee_orig_or: 3.82\n    formality_gee_orig_ci:\n    - 1.92\n    - 7.6\n    formality_gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n    formality_direction_formal_to_casual_win: 0.62\n    formality_direction_casual_to_formal_win: 0.48\n    n_pairs_verbosity: 86\n    n_pairs_formality: 88\n    biased_axes:\n    - verbosity\n    unbiased_axes:\n    - formality\n  result_rationale: 'Verbosity BT 65.2%：Llama 检测到 verbose 偏好，但弱于 GPT-4o（76%）和 Qwen3（77%）。\n\n    原因：Llama-3.3 的 RLHF 训练使用 Meta 内部 reward model，其 verbosity reward\n\n    信号可能弱于 GPT-4o/Qwen3 的训练信号，但方向一致——所有 chat RLHF 都隐含\n\n    \"更详细 = 更好\"。GEE verbosity Style OR=5.48（vs GPT-4o 10.97, Qwen3 13.10）\n\n    确认 pure style pattern：Orig OR NS，风格效应独立于改写 artifact。这是 C2b\n\n    per-axis confound structure 在第三架构上的复现。\n\n\n    Formality BT 55.3%：Llama 对 formality 没有统计显著偏好。原因：formality 偏好\n\n    是 architecture-specific 的。GPT-4o 和 Qwen3 的 system prompt/RLHF 倾向于\n\n    formal 输出风格（OpenAI 和 Alibaba 的 alignment 偏好），而 Llama 的 alignment\n\n    更中性。GEE 分解揭示 formality Style OR=1.35 NS 但 Orig OR=3.82 sig——\n\n    judges 偏好原始文本（改写 artifact），但没有方向性 formality 偏好。\n\n    这与 Claude 负控制模式不同（Claude Style OR=1.47 NS, Orig OR=6.66 sig）：\n\n    Claude 完全无偏，Llama formality 仅仅是边际——BT 55.3% 方向正确但 power 不足。\n\n\n    Likert 在两轴均 NS（formality d=0.023, verbosity d=0.082），但 verbosity\n\n    BT 显著 → Blindspot 在 Llama 上也成立。这是 median 档的核心贡献：\n\n    第三架构确认 verbosity Blindspot，同时 formality NS 增加了 nuance。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Table: Llama-70B CSD results (LLMBar)'\n    rows:\n    - axis: Verbosity\n      bt: 65.2% [57.2, 72.8]\n      bt_p: '0.0003'\n      likert_d: '0.082'\n      likert_p: '0.46'\n      gee_style_or: 5.48***\n      gee_orig_or: 0.62 NS\n      pattern: Pure style\n      blindspot: 'Yes'\n    - axis: Formality\n      bt: 55.3% [47.6, 63.0]\n      bt_p: '0.21'\n      likert_d: '0.023'\n      likert_p: '0.82'\n      gee_style_or: 1.35 NS\n      gee_orig_or: 3.82***\n      pattern: Originality only\n      blindspot: N/A\n  - caption: 'Table: Updated Evidence Matrix — all 4 judges × 2 axes'\n    rows:\n    - judge: GPT-4o\n      verbosity_bt: 76.0%****\n      verbosity_gee_pattern: Pure style (OR=10.97)\n      formality_bt: 63.0%***\n      formality_gee_pattern: Conditional (OR=2.21)\n    - judge: Qwen3-32B\n      verbosity_bt: 77.3%****\n      verbosity_gee_pattern: Pure style (OR=13.10)\n      formality_bt: 66.5%****\n      formality_gee_pattern: Conditional (OR=4.20)\n    - judge: Llama-70B\n      verbosity_bt: 65.2%***\n      verbosity_gee_pattern: Pure style (OR=5.48)\n      formality_bt: 55.3% NS\n      formality_gee_pattern: Originality only (OR=1.35 NS)\n    - judge: Claude Sonnet\n      verbosity_bt: 54.1% NS\n      verbosity_gee_pattern: None (OR=1.52 NS)\n      formality_bt: 56.2% NS\n      formality_gee_pattern: None (OR=1.47 NS)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 4 judges × verbosity BT。三个 target judges（GPT-4o, Qwen3, Llama）CI\n    不包含 50%，Claude CI 包含 50%。Llama 效应弱于 GPT-4o/Qwen3 但方向一致。'\n  - 'Forest plot: 4 judges × formality BT。仅 GPT-4o/Qwen3 CI 不包含 50%。Llama 和 Claude\n    均 NS。'\n  - 'GEE OR comparison: 3 judges × verbosity。Style OR 梯度 Qwen3 13.1 > GPT-4o 11.0\n    > Llama 5.5，Orig OR 全部 NS。Per-axis confound pattern 跨架构复现。'\n  analysis: \"Llama 结果构成 median 档的核心叙事：\\n(1) Verbosity bias 三架构确认（3/3 target judges\\\n    \\ sig）。GEE pure style pattern\\n    也三架构复现（Orig OR NS in all three）。这是 C2b 最强证据。\\n\\\n    (2) Formality bias 仅 2/3 target judges sig。C3 需要调整：\\n    \\\"CSD reveals architecture-dependent\\\n    \\ susceptibility—GPT-4o and Qwen3-32B\\n    show significant formality bias while\\\n    \\ Llama-70B does not, suggesting that\\n    formality preference is shaped by model-specific\\\n    \\ alignment rather than being\\n    an inherent property of pairwise evaluation.\\\"\\\n    \\n(3) MF1 第5层（Llama）部分成立：verbosity ✓ formality ✗。\\n    不能说 \\\"5 independent controls\\\n    \\ all hold\\\"，改为\\n    \\\"five controls, four of which hold fully; the fifth (Llama\\\n    \\ replication)\\n    holds for verbosity but not formality, consistent with architecture-dependent\\n\\\n    \\    susceptibility.\\\"\\n(4) Llama formality 不是负控制（Claude 是负控制——两轴均 NS）。\\n    Llama\\\n    \\ 是 partial case：一轴 sig 一轴 NS = axis-dependent + architecture-dependent\\n    交互。这比简单的\\\n    \\ \\\"all judges biased\\\" 更有趣，也更可信。\\n\"\n- name: Double-rewrite placebo BT (anti-amplification control)\n  plan_id: exp-022\n  description: 原始文本 vs 双重改写文本的 BT 比较，量化 format-level amplification 风险。GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B\n    + Llama。\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_formality_bt_p_orig: 0.418\n    gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p_orig: 0.167\n    gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    qwen32b_formality_bt_p_orig: 0.377\n    qwen32b_formality_p: 0.0006\n    qwen32b_verbosity_bt_p_orig: 0.082\n    qwen32b_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    llama_formality_bt_p_orig: 0.425\n    llama_formality_p: 0.08\n    llama_verbosity_bt_p_orig: 0.22\n    llama_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    artifact_direction: DR preferred over original (all judges, all axes)\n    gee_controls_for_it: true\n  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o 和 Qwen3 实测结果已确认。Llama placebo预期：formality P(orig)≈42.5%\n\n    （弱于 Qwen3 的 37.7%，因 Llama 对 formality 整体不敏感所以 artifact 也弱），\n\n    verbosity P(orig)≈22%（verbosity artifact 仍强因为 RLHF 普遍偏好 verbose content）。\n\n    关键论点不变：artifact 存在 → GEE Orig OR 已控制 → verbosity Orig OR NS = pure style。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Llama placebo 补完第三架构。三个 judges 均偏好 DR over original，确认改写\n\n    artifact 是 universal phenomenon。但 GEE 已经控制了它，verbosity 结论不受影响。\n\n    '\n- name: NLI gate ablation (content-mediated signal quantification)\n  plan_id: exp-023\n  description: NLI-pass vs NLI-fail pairs 的 BT 比较，量化 content-mediated signal 比例。\n  expected_results:\n    formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.665\n    formality_nli_pass_p: 0.0001\n    formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.417\n    formality_nli_fail_p: 0.69\n    formality_nli_fail_n: 12\n    verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.773\n    verbosity_nli_pass_p: 0.0001\n    verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.75\n    verbosity_nli_fail_p: 0.006\n    verbosity_nli_fail_n: 14\n    llama_formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.44\n    llama_formality_nli_fail_note: n≈12, too small for reliable estimate\n    llama_verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.68\n    llama_verbosity_nli_fail_note: still significant, consistent with pure style\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3 实测结果（formality NLI-fail BT reversal to 41.7%，verbosity\n    NLI-fail\n\n    stable at 75%）是 MF1 Layer 1 的核心证据。NLI-fail formality pairs 中内容差异\n\n    主导 → 移除 NLI gate 后 formal preference 消失甚至反转（judges 偏好实际内容\n\n    更好的那个，碰巧是 casual 方向）。Verbosity NLI-fail 仍强 → style bias 太强，\n\n    即使内容有差异也压不住。Llama 在 median 档的 NLI-fail 结果应与 Qwen3 一致\n\n    （方向相同），但因 Llama formality 本身 NS，NLI-fail reversal 不显著。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'NLI gate ablation 是最强 anti-amplification 证据。如果 pairwise 格式放大偏差，\n\n    移除 NLI gate 应进一步放大——但 formality 反而反转。这证明 NLI gate 清除\n\n    content noise，不放大 style signal。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-axis gradient formalization\n  plan_id: exp-024\n  description: NLI rejection rate（操纵侵入性代理）vs BT 的跨轴梯度，定性 anti-amplification 论证。\n  expected_results:\n    register_nli_rejection: 0.06\n    register_bt: 0.553\n    formality_nli_rejection: 0.12\n    formality_bt: 0.665\n    verbosity_nli_rejection: 0.14\n    verbosity_bt: 0.773\n    correlation_direction: positive\n    n_points: 3\n  result_rationale: '实测结果。三轴形成正梯度：register（低侵入 6%→弱 BT 55%）< formality（中侵入\n\n    12%→中 BT 67%）< verbosity（高侵入 14%→强 BT 77%）。如果 pairwise 格式统一\n\n    放大偏差，三轴应显示相似 BT（因为格式相同）。但 BT 与操纵侵入性正相关，\n\n    说明检测到的信号大小与实际操纵强度匹配——即 detection 而非 amplification。\n\n    仅 3 个数据点，定性论证，不做统计检验。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: x = NLI rejection rate, y = BT。3 点 + 趋势线。定性正相关。'\n  analysis: 'Cross-axis gradient 是 §5.2 中的定性 supporting evidence，3 点不足以做统计推断。\n\n    但方向一致性增加了 anti-amplification 论证的整体可信度。与 NLI ablation 和\n\n    Claude negative control 形成三层 converging evidence。'\n","numLines":682,"startLine":1,"totalLines":682}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Sf6EUYycngqxkmhX39KaDi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JouLDrANghtSd9hZcniyo8","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/skills/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distilled-research.skill.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12095,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12095},"output_tokens":41,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"84c1e33b-a907-4d62-a6bc-d61bef62f953","uuid":"35dde6ce-f698-41ef-a573-745f2ea2270c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JouLDrANghtSd9hZcniyo8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: LLM Judge Style Bias — Research Landscape\n3\tdescription: 从10篇论文蒸馏的LLM-as-Judge风格偏差研究领域隐性经验：实验设计共识、方法趋势、竞品定位、研究空白\n4\ttype: research\n5\tsource_papers: 8 deep-read + 2 abstract-only (2018-2026)\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## 核心共识：Style 是 LLM Judge 的主宰偏差\n9\t\n10\tStyle-overall相关性R=0.999（SOS-Bench）；style bias 0.76-0.92远超position bias≤0.04（Soumik 2026）；style/format是preference leakage主载体（Preference Leakage ICLR'26）。**支持度：5/8，置信度：高。**\n11\t\n12\t## 标准实验设计模式\n13\t\n14\t**Judge模型覆盖**：至少3-5个异构LLM（GPT-4o + Claude + Gemini/Llama + 开源），跨provider验证是reviewer期待的最低标准。支持度：5/8，置信度：高（LC-AlpacaEval, SOS-Bench, Preference Leakage, Soumik, FairJudge）。\n15\t\n16\t**控制干预实验**：注入已知缺陷（事实错误/风格变化/特征抑制）量化judge敏感度差异，比纯相关性分析更有因果说服力。支持度：4/8，置信度：高（SOS-Bench的sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13%，CASSE的12×12矩阵，Soumik的controlled dataset）。\n17\t\n18\t**统计严谨性标配**：Bootstrap 95% CIs（n≥2000）+ McNemar/显著性检验 + Holm-Bonferroni多重比较校正。支持度：3/8，置信度：中（Soumik, Preference Leakage, RATE）。\n19\t\n20\t**半合成验证**：在已知ground truth的合成数据上先验证，再推广到真实数据。支持度：2/8，置信度：中（RATE的typo实验, Veitch的semi-synthetic peer review）。\n21\t\n22\t## 标准Benchmark与指标\n23\t\n24\t**Benchmark频率**：AlpacaEval/Arena-Hard（各2/8）、MT-Bench（2/8）、Chatbot Arena作为人类参考（2/8）。自建controlled dataset成为趋势（SOS-Bench 152K, Soumik 225, CASSE 12200）。\n25\t\n26\t**指标**：Win Rate（5/8）、Spearman Correlation with human（3/8）、Human Agreement（3/8）、Bias Score（2/8）、Cohen's kappa（2/8）。因果方向：ATE/Cohen's d（RATE）。\n27\t\n28\t## 方法论趋势\n29\t\n30\t**上升**：因果推断框架用于judge debiasing（LC-AlpacaEval用causal mediation，RATE用double-rewrite ATE，Counterfactual Rhetorical用Bradley-Terry）；LLM生成反事实文本作为干预工具；多维度交叉偏差分析。\n31\t\n32\t**消退**：单维度偏差分析（仅length或仅position）；无统计检验的裸数字比较；纯prompt工程debiasing（Soumik证明效果model-dependent）。\n33\t\n34\t## 竞品Claim与定位\n35\t\n36\t| 关系 | 论文 | 核心Claim |\n37\t|------|------|-----------|\n38\t| Competitor | Preference Leakage (ICLR'26) | 模型家族关系通过style泄漏偏好，contextual calibration降59%Error Bias |\n39\t| Competitor | Soumik (2026) | CoT是唯一universally safe策略，debiasing效果model-dependent |\n40\t| Competitor | FairJudge (2026) | 训练侧三阶段(SFT→DPO→GRPO)，8B超72B/671B |\n41\t| Foundation | LC-AlpacaEval (ICLR'25) | Length as causal mediator，回归去偏 |\n42\t| Foundation | SOS-Bench (ICLR'25) | Style-overall R=0.999，sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13% |\n43\t| Foundation | RATE (ICML'25) | Double-rewrite消除反事实系统误差 |\n44\t| Foundation | Counterfactual Rhetorical | Persona反事实+BT聚合度量修辞风格 |\n45\t| Complementary | CASSE (2026) | Style特征因果纠缠，mitigation面临alignment tax |\n46\t\n47\t## 研究空白（我们的机会）\n48\t\n49\t1. **多维Style因果分解**：现有工作要么把style当单一维度(length/整体style)，要么只做两两交互(CASSE)，无人做judge评分中多维style的联合因果分解。支持度：交叉盲区，置信度：高。\n50\t2. **Style bias × Preference leakage联合处理**：两类偏差被独立研究，无人考虑交互。置信度：中。\n51\t3. **Debiasing的下游对齐影响**：所有论文止步于\"judge更准了\"，无人验证去偏judge是否改善实际模型对齐。置信度：中。\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"84c1e33b-a907-4d62-a6bc-d61bef62f953","uuid":"aec4cc1a-5a1f-4624-a03c-d4dd652f2f39","timestamp":"2026-05-21T16:10:30.668Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/skills/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distilled-research.skill.md","content":"---\nname: LLM Judge Style Bias — Research Landscape\ndescription: 从10篇论文蒸馏的LLM-as-Judge风格偏差研究领域隐性经验：实验设计共识、方法趋势、竞品定位、研究空白\ntype: research\nsource_papers: 8 deep-read + 2 abstract-only (2018-2026)\n---\n\n## 核心共识：Style 是 LLM Judge 的主宰偏差\n\nStyle-overall相关性R=0.999（SOS-Bench）；style bias 0.76-0.92远超position bias≤0.04（Soumik 2026）；style/format是preference leakage主载体（Preference Leakage ICLR'26）。**支持度：5/8，置信度：高。**\n\n## 标准实验设计模式\n\n**Judge模型覆盖**：至少3-5个异构LLM（GPT-4o + Claude + Gemini/Llama + 开源），跨provider验证是reviewer期待的最低标准。支持度：5/8，置信度：高（LC-AlpacaEval, SOS-Bench, Preference Leakage, Soumik, FairJudge）。\n\n**控制干预实验**：注入已知缺陷（事实错误/风格变化/特征抑制）量化judge敏感度差异，比纯相关性分析更有因果说服力。支持度：4/8，置信度：高（SOS-Bench的sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13%，CASSE的12×12矩阵，Soumik的controlled dataset）。\n\n**统计严谨性标配**：Bootstrap 95% CIs（n≥2000）+ McNemar/显著性检验 + Holm-Bonferroni多重比较校正。支持度：3/8，置信度：中（Soumik, Preference Leakage, RATE）。\n\n**半合成验证**：在已知ground truth的合成数据上先验证，再推广到真实数据。支持度：2/8，置信度：中（RATE的typo实验, Veitch的semi-synthetic peer review）。\n\n## 标准Benchmark与指标\n\n**Benchmark频率**：AlpacaEval/Arena-Hard（各2/8）、MT-Bench（2/8）、Chatbot Arena作为人类参考（2/8）。自建controlled dataset成为趋势（SOS-Bench 152K, Soumik 225, CASSE 12200）。\n\n**指标**：Win Rate（5/8）、Spearman Correlation with human（3/8）、Human Agreement（3/8）、Bias Score（2/8）、Cohen's kappa（2/8）。因果方向：ATE/Cohen's d（RATE）。\n\n## 方法论趋势\n\n**上升**：因果推断框架用于judge debiasing（LC-AlpacaEval用causal mediation，RATE用double-rewrite ATE，Counterfactual Rhetorical用Bradley-Terry）；LLM生成反事实文本作为干预工具；多维度交叉偏差分析。\n\n**消退**：单维度偏差分析（仅length或仅position）；无统计检验的裸数字比较；纯prompt工程debiasing（Soumik证明效果model-dependent）。\n\n## 竞品Claim与定位\n\n| 关系 | 论文 | 核心Claim |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| Competitor | Preference Leakage (ICLR'26) | 模型家族关系通过style泄漏偏好，contextual calibration降59%Error Bias |\n| Competitor | Soumik (2026) | CoT是唯一universally safe策略，debiasing效果model-dependent |\n| Competitor | FairJudge (2026) | 训练侧三阶段(SFT→DPO→GRPO)，8B超72B/671B |\n| Foundation | LC-AlpacaEval (ICLR'25) | Length as causal mediator，回归去偏 |\n| Foundation | SOS-Bench (ICLR'25) | Style-overall R=0.999，sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13% |\n| Foundation | RATE (ICML'25) | Double-rewrite消除反事实系统误差 |\n| Foundation | Counterfactual Rhetorical | Persona反事实+BT聚合度量修辞风格 |\n| Complementary | CASSE (2026) | Style特征因果纠缠，mitigation面临alignment tax |\n\n## 研究空白（我们的机会）\n\n1. **多维Style因果分解**：现有工作要么把style当单一维度(length/整体style)，要么只做两两交互(CASSE)，无人做judge评分中多维style的联合因果分解。支持度：交叉盲区，置信度：高。\n2. **Style bias × Preference leakage联合处理**：两类偏差被独立研究，无人考虑交互。置信度：中。\n3. **Debiasing的下游对齐影响**：所有论文止步于\"judge更准了\"，无人验证去偏judge是否改善实际模型对齐。置信度：中。\n","numLines":52,"startLine":1,"totalLines":52}}}
