{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MsiB8YTzJJ1WXY42UEc1bV","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 causal_style_decomp_judge 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (50 个)\\n\\n- **exp-016**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp-015**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp015_clmm**: DONE (success) — \\n- **register_100_cf**: QUEUED — \\n- **exp013_nli_validation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-013**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **register_pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp014_logistic_decomposition**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp012_consistency_bias**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp011_nli_sensitivity**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp010_binarized_likert**: DONE (success) — \\n- **tone_pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **pairwise_32b**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_32b_ate**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_8b_ate**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- register_100_cf: Register axis (academic/conversational) produces detectable style bias in GPT-4o judge comparable to formality axis, with pairwise win rate >= 60% and p < 0.05, demonstrating axis-dependent bias generalizes beyond formality（排队等待 GPU）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **llama70b_third_judge** (success): Llama-3.3-70B as third independent judge architecture confirms the Likert Blindspot: BT pairwise detects style bias (formality + verbosity) with p<0.05 while Likert scoring shows no significant difference, replicating the pattern found with GPT-4o and Qwen3-32B judges\\n- **finegrained_likert_100pt** (success): The Likert Blindspot is NOT a scale granularity artifact: even a 100-point continuous scale (0-100) should fail to detect the style bias that pairwise BT detects, because the blindspot stems from absolute-vs-relative evaluation paradigm differences, not insufficient scale resolution\\n  [finegrained_likert_100pt](/api/workspace-files/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/artifacts/finegrained_likert_100pt/data/finegrained_likert_100pt.json)\\n- **gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity** (success): Verbosity style bias is rewriter-independent: GPT-4o rewriter + Qwen3-32B judge should produce BT probability statistically equivalent to Qwen3-32B rewriter + Qwen3-32B judge, confirming the measured verbosity bias reflects judge behavior not rewriter artifacts\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 34 / 负向 12 / 失败 0 / 共 49\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestb-29275: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp-013: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp-015: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp-016: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wj2CiaHKUBUwsCGmV3oRYB","session_id":"84c1e33b-a907-4d62-a6bc-d61bef62f953","uuid":"8b5c55ff-5a38-47cf-abb3-5e5682fce2d5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T16:11:42.562Z"}
