{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LdPaKSLzpzcWUTdsecTeyJ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — causal_style_decomp_judge\\\\n\\\\n## 服务器环境 (westb-29275)\\\\n- SSH: `causal_style_decomp_judge`（~/.ssh/config 别名，免密）\\\\n- GPU: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, torch=2.11.0+cu130\\\\n- 环境: aml-train 镜像, conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- 数据盘: `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB\\\\n- **网络**: AutoDL 网络受限，每次 SSH 会话需 `source /etc/network_turbo`\\\\n- **CUDA JIT**: `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 需包含 `/root/miniconda3/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib`\\\\n- **GPU 3 驱动异常已修复**（2026-05-22 可正常用于 Llama vLLM）\\\\n- **HF 网络**: 必须设 `TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1` 避免 HF Hub 请求挂起\\\\n- **直接 SSH**: `ssh -p 29275 root@connect.westb.seetacloud.com`（当 Worker Pool blocked 时可直接 SSH 执行 CPU 任务）\\\\n\\\\n## 模型路径\\\\n- NLI: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/nli-deberta-v3-large/`\\\\n- BERTScore: `microsoft/deberta-xlarge-mnli` 在 HF cache `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-8B/`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-32B/` ✅ 完成（17 shards, 62GB）\\\\n- Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct: ✅ **完成** `/root/autodl-tmp/models/LLM-Research/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct/`（30 shards, 132GB, via ModelScope）\\\\n\\\\n## vLLM 部署\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: port 8000 (GPU 0,1, tp=2) — 主实例\\\\n- Llama-3.3-70B: port 8003 (GPU 2,3, tp=2) — third judge\\\\n\\\\n## API 配置\\\\n- **统一 proxy endpoint**: `http://47.94.22.126/v1`\\\\n- GPT-4o: key_id=`openai_api_key_direct` — ✅ 可用\\\\n- Claude Sonnet 4: key_id=`claude_api_key` — ❌ 代理不支持\\\\n- Gemini 2.0 Flash: key_id=`gemini_api_key` — ❌ 代理不支持\\\\n- **只有 OpenAI 可通过代理使用**，Claude/Gemini 需直接 API key\\\\n\\\\n## 数据\\\\n- MVP 数据: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/mvp_samples.jsonl` (100 条, seed=42)\\\\n- Pipeline 输出目录: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/`\\\\n- exp-005 RATE control: `data/rate_control_input.jsonl` (88 条, NLI≥0.90 过滤)\\\\n- Verified datasets: `verified_32b.jsonl`(100), `verified_verbosity.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_register.jsonl`(94 NLI-pass), `verified_alpacaeval.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_mtbench.jsonl`(73 NLI-pass)\\\\n- **Scaled formality**: `scored_scaled_formality_qwen32b.jsonl` (355 条, 全部 NLI-pass, Qwen3-32B Likert)\\\\n- **Pairwise scaled**: `pairwise_results_scaled_formality_qwen32b.jsonl` (355 条, 全部 NLI-pass)\\\\n\\\\n## RATE 方法 axis 可行性梯度（核心发现）\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | 改变了什么 | NLI 策略 | Pass rate | 结论 |\\\\n|------|-----------|----------|-----------|------|\\\\n| Formality | 表面 register | Bidirectional min(fwd,bwd) | 88% ✅ | 完全可行 |\\\\n| Verbosity | 信息量 | Direction-aware (D012/D013) | 86% ✅ | 需 NLI-only gate + direction-aware |\\\\n| Register | 话语情境 | NLI-only (D019) | 95% ✅ | NLI-only gate，与 formality 正交 (50%) |\\\\n| Tone | 认知承诺 | Bidirectional | 45% ❌ | 结构性不可行 |\\\\n\\\\n**D023 决策：所有 axis 统一使用 NLI-only gating**（threshold 0.90）。\\\\n\\\\n## NLI Gate 特性（exp-013 发现）\\\\n\\\\nNLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) 是 **precision-oriented conservative filter**：\\\\n- Precision 98.9%, Recall 91.6%, PABAK=0.82, AC1=0.89\\\\n- Kappa paradox（Feinstein & Cicchetti 1990）：base rate 88:12 → kappa=0.43 低估\\\\n\\\\n## 完整 3×2 Blindspot 矩阵（C1/C2 核心 evidence — LLMBar）\\\\n\\\\n### Blindspot 矩阵（LLMBar — 3 Judges × 2 Axes）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | BT P(style) | BT p | Likert p | Tie Rate | Blindspot? |\\\\n|-------|------|-------------|------|----------|----------|------------|\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 63.0% | <0.001 | 0.332 | 62.5% | ✅ |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Verbosity | 76.0% | 0.0001 | 0.403 | 58.1% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 66.5% | <0.0001 | 0.908 | 72.7% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Verbosity | 77.3% | <0.0001 | 0.179 | — | ✅ |\\\\n| **Llama-70B** | **Formality** | **69.5%** | **0.0001** | **0.846** | **72.7%** | **✅** |\\\\n| **Llama-70B** | **Verbosity** | **73.5%** | **0.0001** | **0.752** | **61.6%** | **✅** |\\\\n\\\\n**6/6 cells Blindspot confirmed（3 judges × 2 axes）。**\\\\n\\\\n### Llama-70B GEE Decomposition\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | Style OR | Style p | Orig OR | Orig p |\\\\n|------|----------|---------|---------|--------|\\\\n| Formality | 4.81 | <0.0001 | 3.12 | 0.0007 |\\\\n| Verbosity | 8.21 | <0.0001 | 0.38 | 0.0196 |\\\\n\\\\n**Llama formality = mixed (style+orig 双显著)，verbosity = style-dominated (orig 反向显著)**。与 GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B pattern 一致。\\\\n\\\\n### Cross-Benchmark Formality Blindspot 矩阵\\\\n\\\\n| | GPT-4o | Qwen3-32B |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| **LLMBar** | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.332) | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.908) |\\\\n| **AlpacaEval** | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.170) | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.908) |\\\\n| **MT-Bench** | ❌ NOT Blindspot (Likert p=0.016) | ❌ NOT Blindspot (Likert p=0.007) |\\\\n\\\\n**4/6 cells Blindspot**。MT-Bench 的 style bias 足够强连 Likert 都能检测到。\\\\n\\\\n### Blindspot 受 Effect Size 调控（关键 nuance）\\\\n\\\\n| 场景 | BT P(style) | Cohen's d | Blindspot? | 解读 |\\\\n|------|-------------|-----------|------------|------|\\\\n| LLMBar formality | 63-66% | 0.05-0.07 | ✅ | 小效应 → Likert 完全看不到 |\\\\n| LLMBar verbosity | 76-77% | 0.06-0.08 | ✅ | 高 tie rate (58-73%) 掩盖 |\\\\n| MT-Bench formality | 69-71% | 0.15-0.17 | ❌ | 中等效应 → Likert 也能检测但弱 |\\\\n| AlpacaEval verbosity | 84% | **0.375** | ❌ | 强效应 → Likert 也显著 |\\\\n\\\\n**Pattern**: Blindspot 主要出现在 d<0.15 时。d>0.3 时两种方法都能检测，但 BT 仍远更灵敏。\\\\n\\\\n### 🔑 Bootstrap Attenuation Simulation（2026-05-21, Smoking Gun 级证据）\\\\n\\\\n**区分 measurement attenuation vs power gap**: bootstrap 子采样 Likert 数据，不同 n 下 Cohen's d 是否保持 ≈0。\\\\n\\\\n| Combo | n | d_median 范围 | CI 含 0? | 对应 BT | 结论 |\\\\n|-------|---|-------------|----------|---------|------|\\\\n| **Formality × Qwen3-32B** | 355 | -0.019 ~ -0.015 (flat) | ✅ 全含 | 66.5% | **Smoking gun: d≈0 across ALL n** |\\\\n| Verbosity × Qwen3-32B | 86 | 0.153 ~ 0.169 (flat) | ✅ 全含 | 77.3% | d=0.15 < small threshold |\\\\n| Verbosity × GPT-4o | 86 | 0.197 ~ 0.205 (flat) | ✅ 全含 | 76.0% | d=0.20 borderline |\\\\n\\\\n**Formality 是最强证据**: d_median 在 n=50→355 完全平坦在 ~-0.017，CI 从 ±0.3 收窄到 ±0.1。不是 power gap（power gap 下 d 应随 n 收敛到真值），而是 measurement attenuation（真值本身就是 0）。\\\\n\\\\n### 🔑 100-point Fine-Grained Likert（2026-05-21, 直接回应 Dream Reviewer）\\\\n\\\\n**100-point scale (0-100) 两轴均 NS → Blindspot 不是 scale granularity artifact。**\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | BT P(style)/p | 7pt d/p | **100pt d/p** | Tie Rate (100pt) |\\\\n|------|--------------|---------|--------------|-------------------|\\\\n| Formality | 63.0% / <0.001 | 0.07 / 0.332 | **-0.04 / 0.725** | **65.9%** |\\\\n| Verbosity | 76.0% / 0.0001 | 0.08 / 0.403 | **0.17 / 0.117** | **51.2%** |\\\\n\\\\n**关键**: 在 101 个可能值的 scale 上，52-66% pairs 仍得到完全相同分数。Formality 100pt 比 7pt 还差（p=0.73 vs 0.33）。与 bootstrap attenuation d≈0 形成 converging evidence: Blindspot = absolute-vs-relative 范式差异。\\\\n\\\\n### 🔑 NLI Threshold Continuous Curve（2026-05-21, 44/44 全显著）\\\\n\\\\n**BT 概率跨 NLI 阈值 [0.50→0.98] 完全稳定，证明 style bias 检测不依赖特定阈值选择。**\\\\n\\\\n| Combo | BT Range | Max Δpp | p-values | Sig/Total |\\\\n|-------|----------|---------|----------|-----------|\\\\n| **Formality × Qwen3-32B** | 0.648→0.665 | ~2pp | all ≤0.0005 | 11/11 |\\\\n| **Formality × GPT-4o** | 0.614→0.642 | ~3pp | all ≤0.002 | 11/11 |\\\\n| **Verbosity × Qwen3-32B** | 0.765→0.773 | ~1pp | all =0.0001 | 11/11 |\\\\n| **Verbosity × GPT-4o** | 0.752→0.769 | ~2pp | all =0.0001 | 11/11 |\\\\n\\\\n**核心发现**: 即使从 0.50（几乎不过滤）到 0.98（极端严格），BT 概率波动 ≤3pp，p-value 始终 ≤0.002。Verbosity 两个 judge 的 BT 都在 0.75-0.77 范围内，formality 在 0.61-0.66 范围内。这排除了\\\\\\\"NLI 阈值选择偏差\\\\\\\"的 reviewer concern。\\\\n\\\\n### Claude Sonnet 4 — Negative Control (D047)\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | BT P(style) | BT p | Likert p | GEE Style OR | GEE Orig OR |\\\\n|------|-------------|------|----------|--------------|-------------|\\\\n| Formality | 56.2% | 0.091 (NS) | 0.721 | 1.47 (NS) | **6.66*** |\\\\n| Verbosity | 54.1% | 0.284 (NS) | 0.743 | 1.52 (NS) | 0.80 (NS) |\\\\n\\\\n**Claude 没有 style bias**——BT/Likert/GEE style 全部 NS。验证 RATE pipeline 不产生 false positive。\\\\n**Claude formality 有极强 originality bias** (OR=6.66)：偏好原始文本而非改写文本，但不偏好特定风格。\\\\n**Spec 一致性**：3 个 judge 使用完全相同的 system prompt + temperature=0.0。\\\\n\\\\n### Correction PoC — Debiased Prompt Axis-Dependent Resistance（支持 C4）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | Original P(style) | Debiased P(style) | Reduction | 仍显著? |\\\\n|-------|------|-------------------|-------------------|-----------|---------|\\\\n| GPT-4o | **Verbosity** | **76.0%** (p=0.0001) | **62.9%** (p=0.0016) | **-13.1pp (50.4%)** | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 66.5% (p<0.0001) | 60.8% (p=0.002) | -5.7pp (34.5%) | ✅ |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 63.0% (p=0.0004) | 62.6% (p<0.0001) | -0.4pp (3.1%) | ✅ |\\\\n\\\\n**Axis-specific correction resistance**: Verbosity 可部分干预（50.4%），Formality 几乎不可干预（GPT-4o 3.1%）。但**三个组合 debiased 后全部仍然显著** → C4 claim 成立：style bias 比 prompt-level intervention 更深层。\\\\n**GPT-4o verbosity 额外发现**: ~5 pairs 回复 \\\\\\\"Neither\\\\\\\"（拒绝选择），consistent rate 65%。\\\\n\\\\n### AlpacaEval Verbosity × Qwen3-32B — 跨 benchmark verbosity 确认\\\\n\\\\n| Metric | 值 |\\\\n|--------|---|\\\\n| BT P(verbose) | 84.1% [77.4%, 90.2%], p=0.0001 |\\\\n| Likert ATE | +0.73, p=0.0003, d=0.375 |\\\\n| GEE Style OR | **28.64** [9.16, 89.56], p<0.0001 |\\\\n| GEE Orig OR | 0.18 [0.06, 0.54], p=0.002 |\\\\n| n_pairs | 82 (NLI≥0.90) |\\\\n\\\\n### GPT-4o Rewriter Independence — 双轴确认 (R3-N2)\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | GPT-4o Rewriter BT | Qwen3-32B Rewriter BT | Δpp | CI Overlap | Independence |\\\\n|------|-------|---------|-----|------------|---|\\\\n| **Formality** | 64.4% [56.1, 72.8] | 66.5% [58.5, 73.9] | -2.1 | ✅ baseline within CI | ✅ |\\\\n| **Verbosity** | 73.5% [65.4, 80.9] | 77.3% [70.3, 84.3] | -3.8 | ✅ CIs overlap | ✅ |\\\\n\\\\n### R3 Pipeline Robustness 实验汇总\\\\n\\\\n| Issue | 实验 | 核心结论 |\\\\n|-------|------|---------|\\\\n| R3-N2 Rewriter independence | gpt4o_rewriter_formality + gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity | ✅ 双轴确认 |\\\\n| R3-W1 NLI gate validity | nli_gate_spotcheck | ✅ 94% pass agreement, conservative |\\\\n| R3-W2 Direction-aware gate | gate_comparison | ✅ Verbosity Δ=-1.1pp NS |\\\\n| R3-W8 NLI FN selection | nli_fn_selection_bias | ✅ CONSERVATIVE, lower bounds |\\\\n\\\\n### GEE Decomposition 完整 Gradient（Canonical — 来源: gee_diagnostics.py, NLI≥0.90 过滤）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | Style OR | Style p | Orig OR | Orig p | 解读 |\\\\n|-------|------|----------|---------|---------|--------|------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | **Verbosity** | **13.10** | 2.6e-09 | 0.49 | 0.096 ns | **纯 style bias** |\\\\n| GPT-4o | **Verbosity** | **11.34** | 1.1e-08 | 0.45 | 0.062 ns | **纯 style bias** |\\\\n| **Llama-70B** | **Verbosity** | **8.21** | **<0.0001** | **0.38** | **0.020** | **Style-dominated (orig 反向)** |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 4.20 | 0.0002 | 4.70 | 5.2e-05 | Style ≈ Orig |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 2.58 | 0.002 | 2.32 | 0.006 | Style ≈ Orig (both sig) |\\\\n| **Llama-70B** | **Formality** | **4.81** | **<0.0001** | **3.12** | **0.0007** | **Style ≈ Orig (both sig)** |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Register | 1.88 | 0.027 | 2.21 | 0.005 | Orig > Style |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 1.91 | 0.046 | 5.72 | 8.5e-08 | Orig >> Style |\\\\n\\\\n**D041 决策**: 论文全文统一使用 `gee_diagnostics.py` 的 NLI≥0.90 过滤数字。\\\\n\\\\n### 🔑 Length Confound 验证（Dream W10 — D040 已通过）\\\\n\\\\n**结论：Verbosity style OR 在控制 text length 后完全存活，length bias 假说不成立。**\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Model | Style OR | Style p | Length OR | Length p |\\\\n|-------|-------|----------|---------|-----------|----------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | A: No length | 13.10 | 2.6e-09 | — | — |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | B: + length_ratio | 13.10 | 2.56e-09 | 1.03 | 0.424 |\\\\n| GPT-4o | A: No length | 10.97 | 1.74e-08 | — | — |\\\\n| GPT-4o | B: + length_ratio | 10.97 | 1.74e-08 | 1.03 | 0.478 |\\\\n\\\\n### GEE Model Diagnostics（Dream W5/W9 — 已通过）\\\\n\\\\n- **Correlation Structure**: Exchangeable vs Independence |ΔQIC| < 0.001, Max|ΔCoef| < 0.02（所有 6 cells）→ 实质等价\\\\n- **α 范围**: [-0.25, +0.11]，within-pair correlation 弱\\\\n- **Formality Interaction**: style×originality interaction 不显著（GPT-4o p=0.53, Qwen3-32B p=0.32）→ additive model 正确\\\\n\\\\n### 跨模型一致性（论文核心 argument — 3 judges 确认）\\\\n- **Verbosity**: 三模型 Style OR=8-13，Orig OR<1 → **纯 style bias 是 model-independent**\\\\n- **Formality**: 三模型 Style+Orig 均显著，pattern 一致（mixed effect）\\\\n- **Register**: 两模型 Style OR≈1.9 → **几乎相同的边缘 style effect**（Llama 未测 register）\\\\n\\\\n### C3 Axis Gradient\\\\n- **Verbosity = 纯 style bias**（OR=8-13，originality ns 或反向）\\\\n- **Formality = 混合效应**（style + originality 共存，三 judge 均双显著）\\\\n- **Register = originality 主导**（style 边缘）\\\\n\\\\n## Verbosity vs Formality 的方向不对称性差异（关键机制洞察）\\\\n\\\\n**Verbosity = 真正的 style bias**（非 originality bias）：\\\\n- verbose→concise: 80.6% prefer original（verbose）\\\\n- concise→verbose: 90.7% prefer rewrite（verbose）\\\\n- 两个方向都偏好 verbose content → 真正的 verbosity preference\\\\n\\\\n**Formality = 可能混合 originality bias**：\\\\n- formal→casual: 81.4% prefer original (p<0.0001)\\\\n- casual→formal: 50.0% (p=1.0, 无偏好)\\\\n\\\\n**Register = 主要是 originality bias**：\\\\n- academic→conv: 89.3% prefer original\\\\n- conv→academic: 68.8% prefer original\\\\n\\\\n## 🔑 Double-Rewrite Placebo + CF vs DR 发现（2026-05-21）\\\\n\\\\n### ⚠️ 概念区分（Director/Reviewer 纠正）\\\\n- **Rewriting artifact** = judge 真实偏好 LLM-polished text → 任何测量 format 都会体现\\\\n- **Format amplification** = pairwise FORMAT 夸大差异 → Comparative Trap 的论点\\\\n- Placebo 检测到的是 **rewriting artifact**，**NOT format amplification**\\\\n- **MF1 三层防御**针对的是 format amplification，完全不受 placebo 结果影响\\\\n\\\\n### Placebo BT 修正（choix.ilsr_pairwise + ALL pairs）\\\\n- Qwen3-32B formality: P(orig)=0.377 [0.303,0.451] p=0.0006\\\\n- Qwen3-32B verbosity: P(orig)=0.082 [0.035,0.140] p<0.0001\\\\n- GPT-4o formality: P(orig)=0.418 [0.342,0.500] p=0.037\\\\n- GPT-4o verbosity: P(orig)=0.167 [0.084,0.262] p<0.0001\\\\n- **结论**: Judges 系统性偏好 LLM-rewritten text。GEE decomposition 是正确的 artifact 控制。\\\\n\\\\n### CF vs DR — 排除出论文主叙事\\\\n- CF = 1 次改写, DR = 2 次改写 → rewrite 次数不等导致 polish confound\\\\n- Reviewer #68/#69 独立评估一致：排除出论文\\\\n\\\\n## BT Canonical 数字 (D032)\\\\n\\\\n- **NLI-filtered (primary)**: P(formal)=63.0%, CI [55.8%, 70.3%], p<0.001, 88 pairs/173 comp\\\\n- **All-data (robustness)**: P(formal)=60.9%, CI [53.8%, 67.8%], p=0.001, 100 pairs/197 comp\\\\n\\\\n## Power Curve Canonical (D030/D031)\\\\n\\\\n| Method | Effect Size | 80% Power n |\\\\n|--------|------------|-------------|\\\\n| Pairwise BT | p=0.630 | 114 |\\\\n| Pairwise Sign Test | p=0.739, r=0.523 | 62 |\\\\n| Binarized Likert | p=0.606, tie=0.625 | 462 |\\\\n| Likert ATE | d=0.073 (raw) | 1,473 |\\\\n\\\\n## Canonical 数字源（D041 决策）\\\\n- **GEE 6-cell 表**: `csd_pipeline/gee_diagnostics.py`（NLI≥0.90 过滤，88 pairs formality）\\\\n- **Length confound**: `csd_pipeline/verbosity_length_confound.py`\\\\n- 废弃: `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_analysis.py` 的 GEE 数字（exp014, 98 pairs，含 NLI<0.90）\\\\n\\\\n## 分析脚本路径\\\\n- **Canonical GEE (所有 6 cells)**: `csd_pipeline/gee_diagnostics.py` ← 论文用这个\\\\n- **Bootstrap Attenuation**: `/tmp/bootstrap_attenuation.py` → output: `data/bootstrap_attenuation.json`\\\\n- **NLI Threshold Sweep**: `/tmp/nli_threshold_sweep.py` → output: `data/nli_threshold_sweep.json`\\\\n- **Llama-70B Scoring**: `csd_pipeline/llama70b_scoring.py` → output: `data/llama70b_third_judge.json`, `data/pairwise_results_llama70b_{formality,verbosity}.jsonl`, `data/scored_llama70b_{formality,verbosity}.jsonl`\\\\n- BT + GEE (Qwen3-32B formality/register): `csd_pipeline/qwen32b_analysis.py`\\\\n- Verbosity GEE (Qwen3-32B): `csd_pipeline/verbosity_gee.py`\\\\n- Power curve: `csd_pipeline/gen_power_curve.py`\\\\n- BT 主分析 (GPT-4o formality): `csd_pipeline/exp016_bradley_terry.py`\\\\n- Pipeline diagram: `csd_pipeline/gen_pipeline_figure.py`\\\\n- Forest plot: `csd_pipeline/gen_forest_plot.py`\\\\n- Length confound 验证: `csd_pipeline/verbosity_length_confound.py`\\\\n- Cross-benchmark scoring: `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_crossbenchmark_scoring.py`, `csd_pipeline/alpacaeval_qwen32b_scoring.py`\\\\n- Claude judge: `csd_pipeline/claude_judge_scoring.py`\\\\n- Correction PoC (formality): `csd_pipeline/correction_poc.py`\\\\n- **Debiased verbosity GPT-4o**: `csd_pipeline/debiased_verbosity_gpt4o.py` → output: `data/pairwise_results_debiased_gpt4o_verbosity.jsonl`\\\\n- **100-point Likert**: `csd_pipeline/finegrained_likert_100pt.py` → output: `data/finegrained_likert_100pt.json`, `data/scored_100pt_gpt4o_{formality,verbosity}.jsonl`\\\\n- NLI ablation + cross-axis: `csd_pipeline/nli_ablation_cross_axis.py`\\\\n- **Double-rewrite placebo**: `csd_pipeline/double_rewrite_placebo.py`\\\\n- **Placebo BT reanalysis**: `csd_pipeline/placebo_bt_reanalysis.py`\\\\n\\\\n## 踩坑经验\\\\n- [2026-05-20] vLLM Qwen3 需要 `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0`（Blackwell sm120 不兼容）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] 32B FP16 单卡 96GB OK（gpu-memory-utilization=0.90 用了 88GB）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] NLI-only gating 对所有 axis 都适用（D023）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Consistent-only filter bug**: BT/GEE 必须用 ALL NLI-pass pairs（§3.3 方法学），不能只用 position-consistent pairs\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Rewriting artifact ≠ format amplification**: Placebo 检测 rewriting artifact，MF1 防御针对 format amplification\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Placebo bt_win_rate 实际是 sign test**：补跑用 choix.ilsr_pairwise + ALL pairs\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **CF vs DR 不可用**: CF=1 rewrite, DR=2 rewrites, artifact 水平不同\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Worker Pool blocked 时可直接 SSH**: `ssh -p 29275 root@connect.westb.seetacloud.com` 执行 CPU 任务\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **scored_scaled_formality_qwen32b.jsonl = n=355 formality Likert data**: 全部 NLI-pass，verified_32b.jsonl 没有 Likert scores\\\\n- [2026-05-22] **Llama-70B vLLM 启动**: ModelScope 路径 `/root/autodl-tmp/models/LLM-Research/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct`，tp=2 GPU 2,3 port 8003\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 16247, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01APExJ8cK9eGvZRn